    ("You really ought to consult a specialist about that persistent cough.", "HIGH", "It is ______________________________ a specialist about that persistent cough.", ["high time you consulted"], "Vazba 'It is high time + podmět + minulý čas' = Je nejvyšší čas, abys...", "It's high time you DID sth."),
