    ("Perhaps they missed the connecting flight in Frankfurt.", "MAY", "They ______________________________ the connecting flight in Frankfurt.", ["may have missed"], "Možnost v minulosti: 'may have + V3'.", "May/Might have done = možná se stalo."),
