    ("If we hadn't hired a local guide, we would have got lost in the canyon.", "FOR", "Had ______________________________ a local guide, we would have got lost in the canyon.", ["it not been for"], "Invertovaný 3. kondicionál: 'Had it not been for...'.", "Had it not been for = Kdyby nebylo."),
    ("The security guard prevented the protesters from entering the lobby.", "STOPPED", "The protesters ______________________________ the lobby by the security guard.", ["were stopped from entering"], "Trpný rod s vazbou 'stop someone from doing sth'.", "Be stopped from + -ing."),
    ("They think the fire started because of a faulty electrical wire.", "THOUGHT", "The fire ______________________________ by a faulty electrical wire.", ["is thought to have been started", "is thought to have been caused"], "Pasivní reporting o minulém ději s trpným infinitivem: 'is thought to have been started'.", "is thought to have been + V3."),
    ("She rarely takes a holiday during the peak summer season.", "DOES", "Seldom ______________________________ a holiday during the peak summer season.", ["does she take"], "Inverze po 'Seldom' v přítomném čase: 'does she take'.", "Seldom + do/does + podmět + V1."),
