    ("Despite having very little experience, he performed admirably.", "EVEN", "He performed admirably ______________________________ very little experience.", ["even though he had"], "Spojka 'even though' vyžaduje celou větu s podmětem a přísudkem.", "Despite + -ing/noun ➔ Even though + věta."),
    ("I don't intend to apologize for telling the truth.", "INTENTION", "I have ______________________________ for telling the truth.", ["no intention of apologizing", "no intention of apologising"], "Vazba: 'have no intention of doing sth'.", "Intention of + -ing."),
    ("Hardly had the concert ended when fans rushed toward the stage.", "SOONER", "No ______________________________ than fans rushed toward the stage.", ["sooner had the concert ended"], "Převod z 'Hardly... when' na 'No sooner... than'.", "No sooner had + subject + V3."),
    ("The director insisted that the report be submitted before Friday.", "ON", "The director insisted ______________________________ submitted before Friday.", ["on the report being"], "Předložka 'on' + pasivní gerundium: 'on the report being submitted'.", "Insist on sth being done."),
    ("Waiters aren't allowed to keep tips at this restaurant.", "PERMITTED", "Waiters ______________________________ tips at this restaurant.", ["are not permitted to keep", "aren't permitted to keep"], "Trpný rod s 'be permitted to': 'are not permitted to keep'.", "Be permitted to = mít povoleno."),
    ("We didn't have enough time to visit the botanical gardens.", "SHORT", "We were ______________________________ to visit the botanical gardens.", ["too short of time", "short of time"], "Idiom: 'be short of time' = mít málo času (s 'too' pro zesílení: too short of time).", "Be short of time/money."),
