    ("It took them three months to recover from the flood damage.", "GET", "It took them three months ______________________________ the flood damage.", ["to get over"], "Frázové sloveso 'get over sth' = vzpamatovat se z něčeho.", "Get over = recover from."),
    ("They are renovating the cathedral at the moment.", "BEING", "The cathedral ______________________________ at the moment.", ["is being renovated"], "Průběhový trpný rod: 'is being + V3'.", "Is being done = právě se dělá."),
    ("Someone stole my briefcase while I was buying a ticket.", "HAD", "I ______________________________ while I was buying a ticket.", ["had my briefcase stolen"], "Kauzativní vazba (nechtěná událost): 'have + něco + V3'.", "Have something stolen = nechat si něco ukrást (být okraden)."),
    ("I'd advise you to back up your files before updating the system.", "BETTER", "You ______________________________ your files before updating the system.", ["had better back up", "'d better back up"], "Vazba pro naléhavou radu: 'had better + holý infinitiv'.", "Had better + V1 (nikoli 'to V1')."),
